          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>In the &quot;Gross profit...&quot; and &quot;Inventory cost...&quot; reports, you can view the details of the inventory cost before the initial material and itemized expenses including the details of the additional goods expenses up to expense items.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>در گزارش‌های «سود ناخالص...» و «بهای موجودی...» می‌توانید جزئیات بهای موجودی را تا مواد اولیه و هزینه‌های تفکیک‌شده، شامل جزئیات هزینه‌های اضافی کالا تا اقلام هزینه، مشاهده کنید.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Nei report &quot;Profitto lordo..., &quot;Costo di produzione delle merci...&quot; è possibile vedere il costo di produzione dettagliato per materiali di produzione e voci di spese, comprese le spese aggiuntive per prodotti, dettagliate per voci di spese.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>W raportach &quot;Dochód brutto..., &quot;Koszt własny towarów..&quot; można zobaczyć szczegóły kosztów własnych do kosztów źródłowych, materialnych i według pozycji, w tym uszczególnienie dodatkowych rozchodów według towarów do pozycji rozchodów.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>В отчетах &quot;Валовая прибыль..., &quot;Себестоимость товаров..&quot; можно увидеть детализацию себестоимости до исходных материальных и постатейных затрат, в т.ч. детализацию дополнительных расходов по товарам до статей расходов.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&quot;Brüt kâr..., &quot;Ürün maliyeti..&quot; raporlarında, maliyet kalemlerine ek maliyetlerin detaylandırılması da dahil olmak üzere, ürün maliyetinin orijinal malzeme ve kalem maliyetlerine detaylandırılmasını görebilirsiniz.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Trong báo cáo &quot;Lãi gộp..., &quot;Giá vốn hàng hóa...&quot; có thể nhìn thấy chi tiết giá vốn đến chi phí từng giai đoạn và chi phí nguyên vật liệu gốc, trong đó có chi tiết chi phí bổ sung theo hàng hóa đến các dạng chi phí.</value>
          </title>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
        <contextMenu>
          <name>ItemizeMaterialAndItemizedExpensesInInventoryCostContextMenu</name>
          <id>181</id>
          <autoFill>true</autoFill>
        </contextMenu>
        <type>CheckBoxField</type>
        <editMode>Enter</editMode>
        <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
        <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
        <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
      </items>
      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>DrillDownProductCostToInitialCosts</name>
        <id>415</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Drill down product cost to initial costs</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>تفکیک بهای محصول تا هزینه‌های اولیه</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Детализировать себестоимость продукции до исходных затрат</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Üretim maliyetini başlangıç maliyetlerine kadar detaylandır</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Drill down product cost to initial costs</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Drill down product cost to initial costs</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Drill down product cost to initial costs</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>Record.DrillDownProductCostToInitialCosts</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
        <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>DrillDownProductCostToInitialCostsExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>439</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>In the &quot;Gross profit ...&quot; and &quot;Inventory cost...&quot; reports, you can see the drill down of manufactured product cost to the initial material and itemized expenses.
It is available when lot accounting version 2.2 is enabled, starting from the date of transition to lot accounting version 2.2.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>در گزارش‌های «سود ناخالص ...» و «بهای موجودی...» می‌توانید تفکیک بهای محصول ساخته‌شده تا مواد اولیه و هزینه‌های تفکیک‌شده را مشاهده کنید.
این قابلیت هنگام فعال‌بودن حسابداری لات نسخه 2.2، از تاریخ انتقال به حسابداری لات نسخه 2.2 در دسترس است.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>В отчетах &quot;Валовая прибыль..., &quot;Себестоимость товаров..&quot; можно увидеть детализацию себестоимости выпущенной продукции до исходных материальных и постатейных затрат.
Работает при включенном партионном учете версии 2.2, начиная с даты перехода на партионный учет версии 2.2.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&quot;Brüt kâr...&quot; ve &quot;Stok maliyeti...&quot; raporları, üretilen nihai ürünlerin maliyetini, orijinal malzeme ve kalem kalem maliyetlere kadar ayrıntılı olarak göstermektedir.
Bu özellik, 2.2 sürümüne geçiş tarihinden itibaren, 2.2 sürümünde etkinleştirilmiş lot muhasebesi ile çalışmaktadır.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>In the &quot;Gross profit ...&quot; and &quot;Inventory cost...&quot; reports, you can see the drill down of manufactured product cost to the initial material and itemized expenses.
It is available when lot accounting version 2.2 is enabled, starting from the date of transition to lot accounting version 2.2.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>In the &quot;Gross profit ...&quot; and &quot;Inventory cost...&quot; reports, you can see the drill down of manufactured product cost to the initial material and itemized expenses.
It is available when lot accounting version 2.2 is enabled, starting from the date of transition to lot accounting version 2.2.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>In the &quot;Gross profit ...&quot; and &quot;Inventory cost...&quot; reports, you can see the drill down of manufactured product cost to the initial material and itemized expenses.
It is available when lot accounting version 2.2 is enabled, starting from the date of transition to lot accounting version 2.2.</value>
          </title>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
