      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>OptionOfAllocatingExpensesForDisposalsInPastPeriods</name>
        <id>436</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Option of allocating expenses to disposals in previous periods</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>گزینه تسهیم هزینه‌ها به واگذاری‌ها در دوره‌های قبل</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Вариант распределения расходов на выбытия в прошлых периодах</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Geçmiş dönemlerdeki çıkışlara gider dağıtım seçeneği</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Option of allocating expenses to disposals in previous periods</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Option of allocating expenses to disposals in previous periods</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Option of allocating expenses to disposals in previous periods</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>OptionOfAllocatingExpensesForDisposalsInPastPeriods</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <titleLocation>Top</titleLocation>
        <toolTip>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>If the simplified option is used, expenses are allocated to sales, expenses, and inventory balances. When you use materials in production, the amounts are written off to the &quot;Production costs in past periods&quot; item.
If the full option is used, expenses are allocated to the entire cost chain, including production.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>اگر از گزینه ساده‌شده استفاده شود، هزینه‌ها به فروش، هزینه‌ها و مانده‌های موجودی تسهیم می‌شوند. هنگام استفاده از مواد در تولید، مبالغ به قلم «هزینه‌های تولید در دوره‌های گذشته» اسقاط می‌شوند.
اگر از گزینه کامل استفاده شود، هزینه‌ها به کل زنجیره بها، شامل تولید، تسهیم می‌شوند.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>При упрощенном варианте распределение выполняется на продажи, на расходы и на остатки на складах. При использовании материалов в производстве суммы списываются на статью &quot;Производственные расходы прошлых периодов&quot;.
При полном варианте распределение выполняется по всей цепочке движения затрат, включая производство.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Basitleştirilmiş seçenekte dağıtım, satışlara, giderlere ve depo bakiyelerine yapılır. Malzemeler üretimde kullanıldığında tutarlar &quot;Geçmiş dönem üretim giderleri&quot; kalemine yazılır. 
 Tam seçenekte dağıtım, üretim dahil olmak üzere tüm maliyet hareketi zinciri boyunca yapılır</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>If the simplified option is used, expenses are allocated to sales, expenses, and inventory balances. When you use materials in production, the amounts are written off to the &quot;Production costs in past periods&quot; item.
If the full option is used, expenses are allocated to the entire cost chain, including production.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>If the simplified option is used, expenses are allocated to sales, expenses, and inventory balances. When you use materials in production, the amounts are written off to the &quot;Production costs in past periods&quot; item.
If the full option is used, expenses are allocated to the entire cost chain, including production.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>If the simplified option is used, expenses are allocated to sales, expenses, and inventory balances. When you use materials in production, the amounts are written off to the &quot;Production costs in past periods&quot; item.
If the full option is used, expenses are allocated to the entire cost chain, including production.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
        <handlers>
          <event>OnChange</event>
          <name>OptionOfAllocatingExpensesForDisposalsInPastPeriodsOnChange</name>
        </handlers>
